      "text": "The spaceport is clearly the artifact of an architect who was as familiar with alien architecture as with human. Instead of square angles, it has many curved walls and domes. The landing pads jut out from the building at various heights. Some of the landing pads are designed with docking tubes specifically for Quarg visitors, and the ceilings are unusually high to accommodate the Quarg, several of whom are walking around and mingling with the humans here.",
